  <text x="400" y="55" text-anchor="middle" fill="#aabbcc" font-size="13" font-family="sans-serif">Site Overview & Design Concept</text>
  <text x="400" y="100" text-anchor="middle" fill="#666" font-size="14" font-family="sans-serif">Submissions/777-shj/jingzhang-ai-innovation-belt</text>
  <text x="400" y="120" text-anchor="middle" fill="#666" font-size="12" font-family="sans-serif">Provisional Boundary | EPSG:4326 | Design Concept Only</text>
  <line x1="50" y1="140" x2="750" y2="140" stroke="#ddd" stroke-width="1"/>
  <text x="50" y="170" fill="#333" font-size="14" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">京张AI创新带总体设计范围11.4平方公里，北至北五环，南至西直门外大街，西至大钟寺东路/荷清路，东至学院路/西土城路。形成'一带三核、多点场景、蓝绿慢行复合环'的空间结构。</text>
  <text x="50" y="190" fill="#666" font-size="12" font-family="sans-serif">The overall design area of 11.4 sq km forms a spatial structure of 'One Belt, Three Cores, Multi-node Scenarios, Blue-Green Slow-traffic Composite Ring'.</text>
  <rect x="50" y="210" width="700" height="350" rx="5" fill="#e8ecf0" stroke="#ccc" stroke-width="1"/>
